      "created_at": "2018-10-22T20:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Would anyone be willing to read my submission?&nbsp; I'm not really a writer, and it's part of a larger story, so I'm concerned that it's layed out poorly or paced badly, or that the plot in general is not explicit enough, and that anyone other than me would need to have already read something that doesn't exist to understand it.</p>\n<p>EDIT: If, despite my insecurities, you are interested in giving me your thoughts, feel free to email me at marksimmons@heflingames.com</p>",
